function rollLoot(m){var msgs=[];var v=m.variant||0;var dm=v>0?getVariantDropMult(v):1;for(var i=0;i<m.loot.length;i++){var l=m.loot[i],rate=l.chance,owned=l.special?((l.id==='mosquitoContainer')?containerOwned:containerFemaleOwned):false;if(v===3&&l.special){if(!owned){if(l.id==='mosquitoContainer'){containerOwned=true;containerKillBase=monsterKills.mosquito||0;}if(l.id==='mosquitoFemaleContainer'){containerFemaleOwned=true;containerFemaleKillBase=monsterKills.mosquitoFemale||0;}refreshMaxHP();msgs.push('\u83b7\u5f97\u7279\u6b8a\u6218\u5229\u54c1\uff1a'+ITEMS[l.id].name+'\uff0c\u56fe\u9274\u5df2\u70b9\u4eae');}continue;}if(l.special&&owned)continue;if(l.perKillBonus)rate+=monsterKills[m.key]*l.perKillBonus;if(Math.random()<rate){if(l.special){if(l.id==='mosquitoContainer'){containerOwned=true;containerKillBase=monsterKills.mosquito||0;}if(l.id==='mosquitoFemaleContainer'){containerFemaleOwned=true;containerFemaleKillBase=monsterKills.mosquitoFemale||0;}refreshMaxHP();msgs.push('\u83b7\u5f97\u7279\u6b8a\u6218\u5229\u54c1\uff1a'+ITEMS[l.id].name+'\uff0c\u56fe\u9274\u5df2\u70b9\u4eae');}else{if(addItem(backpack,l.id,BACKPACK_SLOTS,dm))msgs.push('\u83b7\u5f97\uff1a'+ITEMS[l.id].name+(dm>1?' x'+dm:''));else msgs.push('\u80cc\u5305\u5df2\u6ee1\uff0c'+ITEMS[l.id].name+'\u6389\u843d\u4e22\u5931');}}}if(v===1&&addItem(backpack,'silverShard',BACKPACK_SLOTS))msgs.push('\u83b7\u5f97\uff1a'+ITEMS.silverShard.name);if(v===2&&addItem(backpack,'goldShard',BACKPACK_SLOTS))msgs.push('\u83b7\u5f97\uff1a'+ITEMS.goldShard.name);if(v===3&&addItem(backpack,'flashShard',BACKPACK_SLOTS))msgs.push('\u83b7\u5f97\uff1a'+ITEMS.flashShard.name);return msgs;}
function doAttack(){if(!inCombat||!enemyData)return;var pAtk=parseFloat(getEffectiveATK()),pDef=parseFloat(getEffectiveDEF()),pDmg=Math.max(0,pAtk-enemyData.def);enemyHP-=pDmg;var lines=['\u4f60\u5bf9'+enemyData.name+'\u9020\u6210'+pDmg+'\u70b9\u4f24\u5bb3'];if(enemyHP<=0){enemyHP=0;monsterKills[enemyData.key]=(monsterKills[enemyData.key]||0)+1;addMapExp(selectedDest,1);if(enemyData.variant>0){var _vk=enemyData.key+'_'+(enemyData.variant===1?'silver':enemyData.variant===2?'gold':'flash');variantKills[_vk]=(variantKills[_vk]||0)+1;}refreshMaxHP();var ls2=getLifestealPct();if(ls2>0&&pDmg>0)playerHP=Math.min(playerMaxHP,playerHP+Math.floor(pDmg*ls2));lines.push('\u83b7\u5f97'+enemyData.expReward+'\u4fee\u4e3a\uff0c\u5df2\u51fb\u8d25'+enemyData.name+monsterKills[enemyData.key]+'\u53ea');setExp(exp+enemyData.expReward);lines=lines.concat(rollLoot(enemyData));var _rfV=0;if(enemyData.variant===1&&Math.random()<0.05)_rfV=3;if(enemyData.variant===2&&Math.random()<0.10)_rfV=3;var _rfKey=enemyData.key;if(enemyData.variant===3){var _eid=_rfKey==='mosquito'?'mosquitoContainer':'mosquitoFemaleContainer';if(!enchanted[_eid])enchanted[_eid]=true;if(!((_eid==='mosquitoContainer')?containerOwned:containerFemaleOwned)){if(_eid==='mosquitoContainer'){containerOwned=true;containerKillBase=monsterKills.mosquito||0;}if(_eid==='mosquitoFemaleContainer'){containerFemaleOwned=true;containerFemaleKillBase=monsterKills.mosquitoFemale||0;}refreshMaxHP();}}inCombat=false;enemyData=null;lastCombatLines=null;combatRepeat=0;if(_rfV>0){setTravelMsg(['\u602a\u7269\u88ab\u51fb\u6740\u540e\u7684\u7075\u6c14\u6ca1\u6709\u6d88\u6563\uff0c\u91cd\u65b0\u6c47\u805a\u6210\u4e86\u602a\u7269\u7684\u5f62\u72b6\uff01\u5468\u56f4\u7684\u573a\u666f\u88ab\u6539\u53d8\u4e86\uff01\uff01']);renderTravelLower();var _tb=$travelLower.querySelector('.travel-btns');if(_tb)_tb.style.display='none';setTimeout(function(){startCombat(_rfKey,_rfV);},3000);}else{setTravelMsg(lines);renderTravelLower();}saveGame();return;}var eDmg=Math.max(0,enemyData.atk-pDef);playerHP-=eDmg;if(enemyData.lifesteal&&eDmg>0)enemyHP=Math.min(enemyData.hp,enemyHP+eDmg);var ls=getLifestealPct();if(ls>0&&pDmg>0)playerHP=Math.min(playerMaxHP,playerHP+Math.floor(pDmg*ls));lines.push(enemyData.name+'\u5bf9\u4f60\u9020\u6210'+eDmg+'\u70b9\u4f24\u5bb3');if(enemyData.lifesteal&&eDmg>0)lines.push(enemyData.name+'\u6062\u590d\u4e86'+eDmg+'\u70b9\u8840\u91cf');if(lastCombatLines&&lines.length===lastCombatLines.length&&lines[lines.length-1]===lastCombatLines[lastCombatLines.length-1])combatRepeat++;else{lastCombatLines=lines.slice();combatRepeat=1;}if(playerHP<=0){playerHP=1;inCombat=false;enemyData=null;lastCombatLines=null;combatRepeat=0;defeatedInTravel=true;setTravelMsg(['\u4f53\u529b\u8017\u5c3d\u4e86\uff0c\u5148\u56de\u53bb\u4f11\u606f\u4e00\u4e0b\u5427']);renderTravelLower();saveGame();return;}setTravelMsg(lines);}
function doFlee(){if(!inCombat||!enemyData)return;var pDef=parseFloat(getEffectiveDEF());var eDmg=Math.max(0,enemyData.atk-pDef);playerHP-=eDmg;if(playerHP<=0)playerHP=1;var lines=[enemyData.name+'\u5bf9\u4f60\u9020\u6210'+eDmg+'\u70b9\u4f24\u5bb3\uff0c\u4f60\u9003\u8dd1\u4e86'];inCombat=false;enemyData=null;lastCombatLines=null;combatRepeat=0;setTravelMsg(lines);renderTravelLower();saveGame();}
